  "cover_text": "Well it's been a funny few days. On Saturday morning, the Maple Leafs hockey team bet their best that Lind off could be a champion. Upset by the news like this, Leafs owner Brendan Leipsic stepped in and said, \"I really believe in your honour.\"\n\n\"Yeah, I do believe that, he works for what he does for his team, and obviously, formerly I was like, 'Do you realize what I let the Montreal Canadiens do with Patrick Roy?' \" Leipsic said. \"Now I think, maybe if I had the chance to play my best hockey it might have been better for myself.\"\n\nUnless, that is, Lind's Patrick Roy came up against Green.\n\nSaid",
